              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "der Fahrschein — \"the travel ticket (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ohne Fahrschein darf man nicht in die Straßenbahn. You may not get on the tram without a ticket."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Fahrscheine. The word on official signs; people mostly say die Fahrkarte or das Ticket."
            }
          ]
        },
