              "text": "entwerten — \"to stamp, to validate (a ticket)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Im Bus entwertet sie ihre Fahrkarte. On the bus she stamps her ticket."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to take the value away: once stamped, the ticket cannot be used again. Inseparable: sie hat entwertet."
            }
          ]
        },
